SetAuthorised_Captable_Unit_Concrete_Test
├── when the caller is not the company Governor
│   └── it should revert with OnlyGovernor
├── when the class does not exist
│   └── it should revert with UnknownClass
├── when the class is frozen
│   └── it should revert with FrozenClass
├── when the new amount is below issued plus convertible reserve
│   └── it should revert with AuthorisedExceeded
├── when the new amount would take the class over the vote bound
│   └── it should revert with VotesBoundExceeded
├── when the class converts into another and the target's reserve would break its authorised
│   └── it should revert with AuthorisedExceeded
└── when the new amount fits
    ├── it should set the authorised amount
    ├── given the class converts into another
    │   └── it should move the target's convertible reserve with it
    └── it should emit AuthorisedSet
